# keepassxc quick-unlock patch, rebased onto keepassxc 2.8.0.
# Adds --quick-unlock so a database opened via --pw-stdin / D-Bus openDatabase
# can still use the Windows Hello / quick-unlock key instead of being blocked.
# Flattened from the 4-commit series that was authored against 58aee6f239dc
# (2.7.4+). Re-run "git rebase" against each new keepassxc release.

